@startuml autonomous-offering-service-boundary
title Autonomous Offering / Autonomous Service Boundary ; per ADR-ES-019 section 10

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Autonomous Offering" as AO
class "Autonomous Product" as AP
class "Autonomous Service" as AS

AO --> AP : may comprise / expose
AO --> AS : may comprise / expose

note right
  Per ADR-ES-019 section 10 + AOFF-AUTO-NEG-003 + AOFF-AUTO-NEG-014:
  - Autonomous Offering is NOT Autonomous Service
  - Autonomous Service does NOT automatically make the whole Offering autonomous
end note

@enduml
